<title>MOROCCO: Morocco's Lesieur Cristal raises profits.</title>
<headline>Morocco's Lesieur Cristal raises profits.</headline>
<dateline>RABAT 1997-03-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Morocco's edible oil firm Lesieur Cristal, a subsidiary of conglomerate ONA Group, showed provisional net profits of 344.6 million dirhams ($37 million) in 1996 from 213.1 million dirhams in the previous year.</p>
<p>The figures were published in L'Economiste newspaper on Thursday and showed a turnover of 3.37 billion dirhams for 1996. It gave no comparative figures for 1995 but said the firm's turnover in the first half of 1995 was 1.71 billion dirhams.</p>
<p>($= 9.4 dirhams)</p>
</text>
